  introLines:
  - at: 0.6
    length: 3.2
    text: Long ago, a creature was locked away inside this village...
  - at: 4
    length: 3.2
    text: Tonight it has woken up, and the dead rise from their graves.
  - at: 7.3
    length: 2.6
    text: They fill the streets, and they hide on every roof.
  - at: 10
    length: 2.8
    text: In the hamlet, its servants guard the keys.
  - at: 12.9
    length: 2
    text: Beyond lies the arena. It is waiting for you.
